<title>AUSTRIA: Austria's AMS details 9-mth results.</title>
<headline>Austria's AMS details 9-mth results.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax				  58   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    Group sales				 1,439   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		     996.1 vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    Group order backlog (on Sept 30)	583.7 vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    Group investment			    278   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>    Group workforce			   1,355   vs    n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Austria Mikro Systeme International AG. Year-ago comparisons were not made available by the company due to the consolidation of its two subsidiaries SAMES and Thesys, acquired in late 1995.</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax				148   vs    219.9</p>
<p>    Parent sales				  989.6 vs  1,349.1</p>
<p>    Parent incoming orders		    789   vs  1,325.6</p>
<p>    Parent order backlog (on Sept 30)     346.7 vs    724</p>
<p>    Parent investment			   105   vs    209</p>
<p>    Parent workforce			    695   vs    705</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 254</p>
